OL,3,ARail boss 'in awe' after Kidman and
OL,4,ABullock scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FA call from Hollywood producers asking
OL,7,Fif film stars Nicole Kidman and Sandra
OL,8,FBullock could sit in a vintage railway
OL,9,Fcarriage came out of the blue for
OL,10,Fstation manager Robert Bentley.
OL,12,FThey called him to ask if the duo could
OL,13,Fuse it for their new blockbuster,
OL,14,FPractical Magic 2, a sequel to the 1998
OL,15,Fromantic fantasy tale.
OL,17,FWhile film producers were keen to
OL,18,Ffeature it, they first needed the train
OL,19,Fmoved from North Weald, Essex, to the
OL,20,FWarner Bros Studios in Leavesden,
OL,21,FHertfordshire.
