OL,5,
OL,6,FThe studio filming left Bentley "in
OL,7,Fawe", he said. "When you're stood at
OL,8,Fthe studio and then all of a sudden
OL,9,FSandra is stood next to you, it's hard
OL,10,Fto describe the feeling."
